@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title State L4：Provider 原生结果到 ProviderSendResult 映射
hide empty description

[*] --> NATIVE_RESULT

NATIVE_RESULT --> CONFIRMED : Kafka RecordMetadata
NATIVE_RESULT --> CONFIRMED : Pulsar MessageId
NATIVE_RESULT --> CONFIRMED : RocketMQ SEND_OK

NATIVE_RESULT --> REJECTED : 参数非法 / 权限错误 / topic 错误 / unsupported capability
NATIVE_RESULT --> FAILED_RETRYABLE : 网络连接失败 / 临时客户端错误
NATIVE_RESULT --> UNKNOWN : confirmTimeout / ack lost / future timeout
NATIVE_RESULT --> UNKNOWN : RocketMQ FLUSH_DISK_TIMEOUT
NATIVE_RESULT --> UNKNOWN : RocketMQ FLUSH_SLAVE_TIMEOUT / SLAVE_NOT_AVAILABLE
NATIVE_RESULT --> FAILED_NON_RETRYABLE : 序列化失败 / 明确 Broker 拒绝

CONFIRMED --> [*] : ProviderSendResult.CONFIRMED
REJECTED --> [*] : ProviderSendResult.REJECTED
FAILED_RETRYABLE --> [*] : ProviderSendResult.FAILED + NETWORK_ERROR/CLIENT_ERROR
FAILED_NON_RETRYABLE --> [*] : ProviderSendResult.FAILED + non-retryable failureType
UNKNOWN --> [*] : ProviderSendResult.UNKNOWN
@enduml
